## The Standard is a Commons

The Introduction Layer standard exists to serve the open web, AI systems, and the
entities that use them. Its governance is through the W3C Introduction Layer
Community Group. No commercial entity — including Intelli-Stasis — may unilaterally
modify the standard or restrict conformant implementation by others.

Contributions to the specification are welcomed through the W3C community group process.
Contributions to the reference implementation are welcomed through this repository.
